{"seq":1,"slug":"observational-astronomy","title":"观测天文学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 观测天文学\n\n观测天文学是天文学的核心实践分支，通过收集和分析来自宇宙的各种信号来认识天体的物理性质、运动规律和演化历史。与理论天文学互为补充，观测天文学提供了检验理论预言的直接证据，也不断以意外发现推动理论的更新。\n\n## 学科定位与核心方法\n\n观测天文学的本质是**信息提取**——从天体发出或经过的信号中，推断其距离、温度、化学组成、运动速度、磁场结构等物理量。传统上以电磁波观测为主，覆盖从射电到伽马射线的全波段；21世纪以来，引力波和中微子等非电磁信使的加入，开创了多信使天文学的新时代。\n\n## 技术驱动的学科演进\n\n观测天文学的每一次飞跃都与探测技术的突破密不可分。从伽利略的折射望远镜到 JWST 的 6.5 米铍镜面，从 Jansky 的偶然射电发现到 FAST 500 米球面射电望远镜，从地面单点探测到覆盖全球的 VLBI 和空间天文台网络，技术进步持续拓展人类的观测能力边界。自适应光学使地面望远镜逼近衍射极限，干涉测量将角分辨率提升至微角秒量级，CCD/CMOS 探测器和数据处理管线使巡天规模呈指数增长。\n\n## 当代前沿与重大发现\n\n2020 年代是观测天文学的黄金时期。LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA 在第四次观测运行（O4, 2023–2025）中确认了超过 250 个引力波事件，将引力波瞬变源目录容量翻倍。事件视界望远镜（EHT）持续追踪 M87\\* 黑洞偏振结构的时间演化，揭示事件视界附近磁化等离子体的剧烈湍动。中国天眼 FAST 在脉冲星搜寻和快速射电暴研究中保持世界领先，截至 2025 年底已发现超过 1150 颗脉冲星。Vera C. Rubin 天文台于 2026 年初发布首批科学警报，标志着时域天文学进入每晚数百万量级瞬变源监测的新纪元。IceCube 中微子天文台最新数据揭示宇宙中微子能谱在约 30 TeV 处存在拐折结构，暗示多种天体物理加速机制的共同贡献。\n\n## 本 Hub 结构\n\n本 Hub 按观测天文学的核心维度组织为四个章节：电磁波谱观测涵盖光学、射电和高能波段的原理与实践；望远镜技术聚焦光学设计、射电干涉和空间望远镜平台；观测技术深入测光光谱、天体测量和自适应光学方法；多信使天文学则展示引力波、中微子和时域观测如何协同构建宇宙的完整图景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electromagnetic-spectrum","title":"电磁波谱观测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optical-astronomy","title":"光学天文学：可见光与近红外观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum/optical-astronomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radio-astronomy","title":"射电天文学：无线电波段的宇宙探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum/radio-astronomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-energy-astronomy","title":"高能天文学：X 射线与伽马射线观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/electromagnetic-spectrum/high-energy-astronomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"telescope-technology","title":"望远镜技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optical-telescope-design","title":"光学望远镜设计：从折射到分段反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/optical-telescope-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"radio-interferometry","title":"射电干涉测量：从基线到成像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/radio-interferometry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"space-telescopes","title":"空间望远镜：突破大气层的限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/space-telescopes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"observational-techniques","title":"观测技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photometry-spectroscopy","title":"测光与光谱学：天体物理量的定量提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques/photometry-spectroscopy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"astrometry-parallax","title":"天体测量与视差：精确定位宇宙的坐标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques/astrometry-parallax"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-optics","title":"自适应光学：实时补偿大气湍流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/observational-techniques/adaptive-optics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"multi-messenger-astronomy","title":"多信使天文学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/multi-messenger-astronomy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gravitational-wave-detection","title":"引力波探测：聆听时空的涟漪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/multi-messenger-astronomy/gravitational-wave-detection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neutrino-astronomy","title":"中微子天文学：穿透宇宙的幽灵粒子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/multi-messenger-astronomy/neutrino-astronomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"time-domain-astronomy","title":"时域天文学：捕捉宇宙的瞬变与变化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/multi-messenger-astronomy/time-domain-astronomy"}]}]}